## 12) Metrics That Matter Early\par
\par
Primary:\par
- 3-second and 30-second video retention\par
- Saves/bookmarks/shares\par
- Comments per 1,000 impressions\par
- Followers from non-follower reach\par
\par
Secondary:\par
- Link clicks\par
- Profile visits\par
- Newsletter signups (if you add one)\par
\par
Set a weekly review ritual:\par
- What hook worked?\par
- Which segment dropped viewers?\par
- Which prevention tips drove comments?\par
